    "text": "Hope you are doing good\n\nOur Client Is Looking For an SharePoint Architect\n\nFind below the Job Description. Kindly reply to me back with your updated resume, contact details, and the best time to reach you. \n\n \n\nJob Term: Contract – (6+ months)\n\nProject Location : Remote Work\n\nInterview Mode: Phone and /or Virtual (Video) interview\n\nVisa – NO H1B\n\n \n\n \n\nJob Description.\n\n \n\n*             10+ in Microsoft 365 / SharePoint Online architecture and administration ​\n\n*             5+ years leading architectural assessments, governance design, and intranet remediation projects \n\n \n\nKey Technical Skills:\n\n \n\n*         SharePoint Online architecture and administration \n\n*         Multi-Hub site / spoke site topology design \n\n*         Managed metadata, content types, taxonomy \n\n*         Information architecture and search configuration \n\n*         SharePoint Migration Tool (SPMT), Sharegate \n\n*         PnP PowerShell and SPFx development \n\n*         Microsoft 365 governance and compliance (Purview, DLP) \n\n*         Power Platform (Power Automate, Power Apps) \n\n*         Azure AD / Entra ID permissions and security groups \n\n*         Microsoft Teams and Viva integration \n\n*         Tenant-to-tenant migration and remediation \n\n*         Change management and adoption strategy\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\nThanks & Regards,\n\nKartikey Agrawal | Sr. Technical Recruiter | KPG99, INC\n\nDirect: 609-934-5232 \n\n\n\n3240 E State St EXT , Hamilton, NJ 08619\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n",
